      "updated_at": "2021-01-06T12:23:58Z",
      "body": "Yes, I know. But ASB is still processing the IP, so that touches GDPR. Before reviewing the code, it was not entirely clear to me in what way not storing the IP (e.g. via Remove IP) would impact ASB. This is something that should be documented, as removing or anonymizing the comment IP will become more common in the next few months.",
