      "created_at": "2018-03-01T14:54:02Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-03-01T14:54:02Z",
      "body": "```\r\n\t\t$filter = array('`comment_author_IP` = %s');\r\n\t\t$params = array( wp_unslash($ip) );\r\n\r\n\t\t// Match the URL\r\n\t\tif ( ! empty($url) ) {\r\n\t\t\t$filter[] = '`comment_author_url` = %s';\r\n\t\t\t$params[] = wp_unslash($url);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t// Match the E-mail\r\n\t\tif ( ! empty($email) ) {\r\n\t\t\t$filter[] = '`comment_author_email` = %s';\r\n\t\t\t$params[] = wp_unslash($email);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t// Perform query\r\n\t\t$result = $wpdb->get_var(\r\n\t\t\t$wpdb->prepare(\r\n\t\t\t\tsprintf(\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\"SELECT `comment_ID` FROM `$wpdb->comments` WHERE `comment_approved` = 'spam' AND (%s) LIMIT 1\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\timplode(' OR ', $filter)\r\n\t\t\t\t),\r\n\t\t\t\t$params\r\n\t\t\t)\r\n\t\t);\r\n```\r\nit would still check on email and url for incoming comments.\r\n",
